[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 16622.39, "timestamp": "04:37:02", "text": "你用一只手驯服了一只手，就是这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16625.189, "timestamp": "04:37:05", "text": "工作？不，那样行不通。呃，等等。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16628.31, "timestamp": "04:37:08", "text": "按钮在哪儿来着？就像 F. F."}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16632.07, "timestamp": "04:37:12", "text": "好的。 F. 我们如何获得食物？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16635.51, "timestamp": "04:37:15", "text": "我们该如何给乔弄到食物？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16637.349, "timestamp": "04:37:17", "text": "找一些。好的，我觉得这样奏效了。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16639.269, "timestamp": "04:37:19", "text": "我觉得这样奏效了。等等，我可以吃吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16645.349, "timestamp": "04:37:25", "text": "接下来是鱼吗？嘿，我们走吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16647.429, "timestamp": "04:37:27", "text": "嘿，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16650.31, "timestamp": "04:37:30", "text": "帮派斗殴。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16653.189, "timestamp": "04:37:33", "text": "顺便说一句，你需要去打猎。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16655.67, "timestamp": "04:37:35", "text": "如果你想活下去。是的。呃，我需要"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16657.99, "timestamp": "04:37:37", "text": "一个工具，等等，我还需要什么来着？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16665.83, "timestamp": "04:37:45", "text": "呃，打架。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16669.109, "timestamp": "04:37:49", "text": "哦，我没有金块。单身的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16671.189, "timestamp": "04:37:51", "text": "斗争。我们看看能不能找到更多"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16672.949, "timestamp": "04:37:52", "text": "蜘蛛腺仍然存在，否则我们就不需要了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16676.629, "timestamp": "04:37:56", "text": "不再那样了。我们或许应该堆起来"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16678.629, "timestamp": "04:37:58", "text": "一些。我得到了一个。我越来越明白了"}]